OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA chilly start to Friday with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunny spells. Perhaps a few
OL,7,Fshowers further north and west later.
OL,8,FNoticeably cooler in a northwesterly
OL,9,Fbreeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry with sunny spells through the
OL,13,Fweekend. Chilly nights bring a risk of
OL,14,Ffrost and patchy fog. Breezier Sunday,
OL,15,Fwith the odd shower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
